{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藝人陸浩明近日現身香港理工大學出席親生胞弟陸浩輝畢業典禮，見證對方成功獲取一級榮譽學位。兩兄弟由細到大生活點滴 …</p><p></p>\n<p>藝人陸浩明近日現身香港理工大學出席親生胞弟陸浩輝畢業典禮，見證對方成功獲取一級榮譽學位。兩兄弟由細到大生活點滴隨着帖文公開，揭開了胞弟多年來半工讀辛酸史。然而一張罕有曝光童年合照瞬間成為全網焦點，意外引發極大爭議。</p>\n<h2>陸浩明親赴理大祝賀胞弟獲取一級榮譽學位</h2>\n<p>陸浩明親自前往香港理工大學參與胞弟陸浩輝畢業典禮，並在社交平台上載多張現場溫馨合照。相片中清晰可見現場懸掛着恭賀橫額，上面列明陸浩輝以一級榮譽優異成績畢業。陸浩明在帖文中激動留言：「恭喜細佬，讀咗幾年終於畢業啦！ 一邊返工一邊返學，成功畢業，展開你人生嘅新一頁，努力加油！」字裏行間流露對胞弟達成學業目標深深驕傲與無限支持。</p>\n<h2>陸浩明主動曬童年照揭兩兄弟昔日模樣</h2>\n<p>為了進一步與大眾分享這份難以掩飾喜悅，陸浩明隨後更大方上載兩兄弟小時候合照作對比。他親自向外界發出提問：「我哋細路仔同依家個樣認得出嗎？」這番舉動直接將焦點從學術成就轉移到兩人外貌演變之上。相片清楚展示了這對親兄弟無論是兒時階段還是成年後外貌特徵，均展現出截然不同發展軌跡。</p>\n<h2>網民笑指陸浩明細佬似阿哥多啲</h2>\n<p>照片一出即時掀起網上熱烈討論，大批網民紛紛就兩人外貌差距發表意見。有人直指：「細佬似呀哥多啲」，同時亦有不少網民針對顏值高低各自表態，分別留言力撐：「你靚仔過你細佬」以及「細佬好似靚仔過你」。向來以瘦底見稱陸浩明竟被眼利網民透過童年照看穿隱藏過去，直接留言驚呼：「你細個原來係肥仔」！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314049456577_11953150606ae3f084e1e35.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陸浩明 一級榮譽 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314049456577_11953150606ae3f084e1e35.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314355396703_14465571506ae3f0883f6f5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陸浩明 一級榮譽 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314355396703_14465571506ae3f0883f6f5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314747964775_17125551086ae3f08bbf282.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陸浩明 一級榮譽 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314747964775_17125551086ae3f08bbf282.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332315757919025_8607231426ae3f09648db8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陸浩明 一級榮譽 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332315757919025_8607231426ae3f09648db8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1_3229339866a994c9716d47-1024x768.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陸浩明 一級榮譽 （圖片來源：新城）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1_3229339866a994c9716d47-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：新城）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455710330847683_708533_19084608336a912fa3b25f5-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陸浩明 一級榮譽 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455710330847683_708533_19084608336a912fa3b25f5-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455770972247298_708533_2200757376a912f94bf618-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陸浩明 一級榮譽 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455770972247298_708533_2200757376a912f94bf618-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b8%80%e7%b4%9a%e6%a6%ae%e8%ad%bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">一級榮譽</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%90%86%e5%a4%a7%e7%95%a2%e6%a5%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">理大畢業</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b8%e6%b5%a9%e6%98%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陸浩明</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：IG@lukhoo、新城資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3532457\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 30 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:21:50.403564+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1104,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T01:19:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:49.673345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:34.911529+00:00","content_hash":"f01387f43de441a44db5fc0d1204e1582fcba8fce30aff9ffc10da13d66f1f09","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}